WEBVTT

00:00:20.731 --> 00:00:21.771
What on earth?!

00:00:25.151 --> 00:00:26.191
Look over there!

00:00:53.301 --> 00:00:54.131
It's closing in!

00:00:54.881 --> 00:00:56.011
Who's available?

00:00:56.301 --> 00:01:00.061
We've received word that Lightning Max
and Smile Man are on their way.

00:01:00.061 --> 00:01:02.101
Get me that threat level assessment!

00:01:08.191 --> 00:01:10.821
As you can see, massive explosions
are going off behind me!

00:01:10.821 --> 00:01:14.201
The monster is wreaking destruction on an unprecedented scale!

00:01:14.191 --> 00:01:17.821
Live broadcast from City A

00:01:14.191 --> 00:01:17.821
Large explosion in City A

00:01:14.191 --> 00:01:17.821
[Traffic news] Traffic on the road connecting cities A through J is backed up due to a blockade.

00:01:14.201 --> 00:01:17.571
While the Association's assessment
is still underway, it is already clea—

00:01:15.991 --> 00:01:17.821
[Railroad news]

00:01:22.251 --> 00:01:22.871
Guess I'll go.

00:01:36.301 --> 00:01:38.801
JUSTICE

00:01:36.801 --> 00:01:38.801
ENFORCEMENT

00:01:42.311 --> 00:01:44.641
Papa! Mama!

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:05.161
And who do we have here?

00:02:08.831 --> 00:02:11.041
Just a guy who's a hero for fun.

00:02:12.551 --> 00:02:13.761
What kind…

00:02:14.131 --> 00:02:17.261
of half-assed backstory is that?

00:02:17.261 --> 00:02:21.301
I was formed from the pollution with which
you humans have covered the earth.

00:02:21.851 --> 00:02:23.681
I am Vaccine Man!

00:02:24.311 --> 00:02:27.191
Earth is a single living organism.

00:02:27.191 --> 00:02:32.321
Humans are nothing but an infectious disease,
eating away at her life force.

00:02:32.731 --> 00:02:36.861
In order to obliterate the humans
and their evil civilization,

00:02:36.861 --> 00:02:41.071
Mother Earth has given birth to me!

00:02:41.071 --> 00:02:44.621
You say you do this for fun? For fun?

00:02:44.621 --> 00:02:49.041
How dare you confront me, Mother Earth's apostle,
for such an inane reason?!

00:02:49.041 --> 00:02:51.001
Yet, what more could be expected from a hu—

00:03:02.891 --> 00:03:03.431
Not again…

00:03:03.971 --> 00:03:06.101
All it took was one punch!

00:03:06.521 --> 00:03:10.981
God damn it!

00:03:20.321 --> 00:03:24.071
ONE PUNCH

00:03:27.781 --> 00:03:29.531
THREE, TWO, ONE, KILL SHOT

00:03:29.531 --> 00:03:33.291
JOIN THE FIGHT, CERTAIN VICTORY, THE STRONGEST EVER

00:03:29.531 --> 00:03:33.291
SANJOU, HISSHOU, SHIJOU SAIKYOU

00:03:33.291 --> 00:03:35.291
WHAT WAS THAT? FRUSTRATION

00:03:33.291 --> 00:03:35.291
NAN DATTEN DA? FRUSTRATION

00:03:35.291 --> 00:03:36.791
THERE'S NO STOPPING ME

00:03:35.291 --> 00:03:36.791
ORE WA TOMARANAI

00:03:36.791 --> 00:03:40.921
ONE PUNCH, IT'S OVER, VICTORY AFTER VICTORY

00:03:36.791 --> 00:03:40.921
ONE PUNCH, KANRYOU, RENSENRENSHOU

00:03:40.921 --> 00:03:44.551
I WIN, I ALWAYS WIN, OVERWHELMINGLY

00:03:40.921 --> 00:03:44.551
ORE WA KATSU, TSUNE NI KATSU, ASSHOU

00:03:44.551 --> 00:03:48.391
POWER, GET POWER

00:03:48.391 --> 00:03:51.351
RIGHT TO THE VERY LIMIT

00:03:48.391 --> 00:03:51.351
GIRIGIRI GENKAI MADE

00:03:51.351 --> 00:03:52.561
HERO

00:03:52.561 --> 00:03:55.731
PEOPLE SHOWER ME WITH PRAISE

00:03:52.561 --> 00:03:55.731
ORE O TATAERU KOE YA

00:03:55.731 --> 00:03:58.771
BUT I DON'T DO THIS FOR THE FAME

00:03:55.731 --> 00:03:58.771
KASSAI NANTE HOSHIKU WA NAI SA

00:03:58.771 --> 00:04:00.021
HERO

00:04:00.021 --> 00:04:04.781
SO I JUST FIGHT EVIL IN SECRET

00:04:00.021 --> 00:04:04.781
DAKARA HITOSHIREZU AKU TO TATAKAU

00:04:04.781 --> 00:04:06.241
(NOBODY KNOWS WHO HE IS)

00:04:06.241 --> 00:04:10.411
COUNTLESS ENEMIES FILL THE SKY

00:04:06.241 --> 00:04:10.411
SORA OOI OSHIYOSERU TEKI

00:04:10.411 --> 00:04:13.491
BUT I WON'T TURN MY BACK AND FLEE

00:04:10.411 --> 00:04:13.491
ORE WA SE WO MUKE WA SHINAI

00:04:13.491 --> 00:04:14.831
HERO

00:04:14.831 --> 00:04:19.831
I'VE MADE UP MY MIND AND I WON'T GIVE IN

00:04:14.831 --> 00:04:19.831
NARABA YURUGINAKI KAKUGO SHITA TAME

00:04:19.831 --> 00:04:27.051
A FIGHTING HERO

00:04:19.831 --> 00:04:27.051
TATAKAU HERO

00:04:27.051 --> 00:04:33.601
A SOLITARY HERO

00:04:27.051 --> 00:04:33.601
KODOKU NA HERO

00:04:33.601 --> 00:04:38.601
I WANNA BE THE STRONGEST HERO

00:04:33.601 --> 00:04:38.601
I WANNA BE A SAIKYOU HERO

00:04:42.071 --> 00:04:45.781
THREE YEARS EARLIER

00:04:46.031 --> 00:04:46.911
A monster!

00:04:46.911 --> 00:04:47.871
Run!

00:04:51.161 --> 00:04:51.871
Huh?

00:04:52.331 --> 00:04:55.081
You sure you don't want to run away?

00:05:00.881 --> 00:05:04.171
I bet you're a newly employed
businessman who's already jaded.

00:05:04.171 --> 00:05:07.761
I ate too much crab and transformed into this!

00:05:07.761 --> 00:05:11.221
Why aren't you running from the mighty Crablante?

00:05:12.931 --> 00:05:14.931
Do you want to die?

00:05:14.931 --> 00:05:16.891
Is that it?

00:05:16.891 --> 00:05:18.561
Well, not quite.

00:05:19.941 --> 00:05:22.441
I'm no businessman. I'm unemployed.

00:05:23.031 --> 00:05:25.281
Right now, I'm looking for a job.

00:05:26.281 --> 00:05:29.571
I had another interview today and got royally rejected.

00:05:30.451 --> 00:05:32.541
I couldn't care less about anything.

00:05:33.581 --> 00:05:38.331
So I'm in no mood to run just because
"the mighty Crablante" has appeared.

00:05:41.541 --> 00:05:44.171
So, what happens if I don't run?

00:05:46.921 --> 00:05:49.761
Your eyes are lifeless, just like mine.

00:05:49.761 --> 00:05:54.221
From one set of lifeless eyes to another, I'll let you go.

00:05:54.221 --> 00:05:56.061
Besides, right now…

00:05:56.061 --> 00:05:58.481
I'm hunting different prey.

00:05:59.901 --> 00:06:01.311
A big-chinned brat.

00:06:02.151 --> 00:06:04.821
And when I find him,
I'm gonna tear him apart!

00:06:19.461 --> 00:06:20.631
What're you looking at?

00:06:21.171 --> 00:06:23.091
A big-chinned brat…

00:06:23.091 --> 00:06:24.631
If he gets caught, he's dead!

00:06:25.591 --> 00:06:26.921
Hey, kid.

00:06:26.921 --> 00:06:29.341
Were you messing with a big crab monster?

00:06:29.341 --> 00:06:29.881
Huh?

00:06:31.141 --> 00:06:34.391
He was asleep in the park, so I drew some nipples on him with my marker.

00:06:35.641 --> 00:06:36.971
It's definitely him!

00:06:37.601 --> 00:06:40.651
He has no idea what he's done.

00:06:40.651 --> 00:06:42.521
What do I do? I could still help!

00:06:44.321 --> 00:06:46.481
But man, this kid's pretty ugly…

00:06:47.031 --> 00:06:48.531
It's none of my business.

00:06:49.321 --> 00:06:50.611
I should just walk away.

00:06:51.821 --> 00:06:55.031
Right. I mean, why should I care?

00:06:56.741 --> 00:06:59.831
There you are!

00:07:02.331 --> 00:07:04.211
What the hell am I doing?

00:07:06.961 --> 00:07:08.921
Kid, he's after you !

00:07:08.921 --> 00:07:10.011
Hurry up and run!

00:07:12.431 --> 00:07:14.891
Don't worry about me. Just go!

00:07:15.471 --> 00:07:16.971
B-But…

00:07:17.771 --> 00:07:19.481
My soccer ball…

00:07:19.481 --> 00:07:20.311
Your ball?!

00:07:22.731 --> 00:07:25.821
Hey, what do you think you're doing?

00:07:25.821 --> 00:07:28.781
Don't tell me you're gonna
protect that stinkin' brat!

00:07:29.191 --> 00:07:33.611
Come on, you're gonna kill him
over some harmless prank?

00:07:33.611 --> 00:07:35.531
Think about this!

00:07:36.531 --> 00:07:39.121
I've already mutilated tons of people.

00:07:39.121 --> 00:07:43.501
Anyone who mocks my appearance
pays the price. No exceptions.

00:07:45.041 --> 00:07:47.291
And that brat…

00:07:47.291 --> 00:07:50.551
drew nipples on my body!

00:07:50.551 --> 00:07:51.631
With permanent marker!

00:07:52.551 --> 00:07:55.301
Look at these claws!
I can't even use a towel to wipe it off!

00:07:56.721 --> 00:08:01.641
Get out of my way, or I'll make sure you never go job hunting again!

00:08:12.951 --> 00:08:14.741
I just realized.

00:08:14.741 --> 00:08:17.741
You look just like a villain
from an anime I used to watch!

00:08:27.041 --> 00:08:28.041
Die.

00:08:33.631 --> 00:08:35.261
Hold it right there.

00:08:35.261 --> 00:08:38.851
In this age of declining birth rates,
I can't just let you kill a kid.

00:08:41.391 --> 00:08:42.431
You know what?

00:08:43.021 --> 00:08:46.311
When I was a little boy, I wanted to be a hero.

00:08:46.311 --> 00:08:48.521
Not a businessman,

00:08:48.521 --> 00:08:52.571
but a hero who could send scum
like you flying with one punch.

00:08:53.151 --> 00:08:54.781
Screw looking for a job!

00:08:55.861 --> 00:08:57.531
Bring it on!

00:08:57.531 --> 00:09:01.831
Some hero you are!

00:09:02.411 --> 00:09:04.461
You're pathetic!

00:09:05.121 --> 00:09:07.421
You don't stand a chance against me.

00:09:09.041 --> 00:09:10.131
It's time…

00:09:11.001 --> 00:09:12.631
to die!

00:09:36.861 --> 00:09:39.571
Has it really been three years since then?

00:09:44.411 --> 00:09:45.371
After that day,

00:09:46.211 --> 00:09:49.131
I trained so hard I went bald.

00:09:49.131 --> 00:09:51.211
I've become so powerful, no one can beat me.

00:09:51.791 --> 00:09:54.131
I'm the hero I dreamed of becoming.

00:09:55.301 --> 00:09:57.801
So what's this feeling?
What am I missing?

00:09:59.721 --> 00:10:02.931
Why does my heart feel so empty?

00:10:03.641 --> 00:10:05.681
482 yen, please.

00:10:06.021 --> 00:10:06.641
Okay.

00:10:08.141 --> 00:10:09.771
Oh, hang on.

00:10:16.321 --> 00:10:17.821
I have 82 yen.

00:10:42.391 --> 00:10:43.261
Incredible…

00:10:44.011 --> 00:10:46.221
This is incredible, little brother!

00:10:47.101 --> 00:10:49.561
I never thought it would work so well.

00:10:51.691 --> 00:10:52.611
Yes,

00:10:53.151 --> 00:10:55.941
it's more than I'd ever imagined, big brother.

00:10:57.651 --> 00:11:00.861
My goal was to become stronger than any other man in the world.

00:11:02.571 --> 00:11:03.911
The strongest man.

00:11:04.661 --> 00:11:06.491
That was my dream.

00:11:08.911 --> 00:11:13.211
At last, the ultimate steroid, Biceps King, is complete!

00:11:15.001 --> 00:11:16.501
Little brother!

00:11:16.501 --> 00:11:19.511
Drink this and you will obtain
the power you've been seeking!

00:11:20.671 --> 00:11:23.471
What? Drink that?

00:11:23.471 --> 00:11:27.641
Indeed! I added strawberry flavoring
to make it go down easier.

00:11:28.351 --> 00:11:29.521
Brother…

00:11:34.191 --> 00:11:34.811
Yes,

00:11:35.941 --> 00:11:38.361
th-this will do!

00:11:39.691 --> 00:11:42.071
My brains and your brawn!

00:11:42.071 --> 00:11:45.531
By combining the brightest of minds
and the strongest of bodies,

00:11:45.531 --> 00:11:51.291
we brothers will conquer the
entire world and rule as kings!

00:11:58.711 --> 00:12:00.301
I-Incredible!

00:12:00.921 --> 00:12:02.421
Well done, little brother.

00:12:02.421 --> 00:12:04.051
Thousands have perished!

00:12:04.051 --> 00:12:07.301
Now, on to the next town to destroy it as well!

00:12:08.351 --> 00:12:11.431
This is it, big bro.

00:12:11.431 --> 00:12:13.641
This is what I was looking for.

00:12:13.641 --> 00:12:15.811
The power to be the strongest.

00:12:16.191 --> 00:12:19.691
This is an emergency evacuation warning.

00:12:19.691 --> 00:12:24.321
A giant creature has appeared in City D.

00:12:24.321 --> 00:12:28.741
The creature is currently heading towards City B.

00:12:28.741 --> 00:12:33.001
All residents of the area,
please evacuate immediately.

00:12:33.001 --> 00:12:36.131
I repeat, the giant creature is currently heading for…

00:12:37.001 --> 00:12:39.551
Yes, that's right! Scatter like rats!

00:12:39.551 --> 00:12:40.961
Get them!

00:12:40.961 --> 00:12:43.131
I'm the strongest man,

00:12:43.131 --> 00:12:46.471
I'm the strongest man. I'm the strongest man.

00:12:46.761 --> 00:12:49.141
What do you think, brother?

00:12:49.141 --> 00:12:51.561
Yeah, how's it feel being the strongest?

00:12:51.561 --> 00:12:51.891
What?!

00:12:52.351 --> 00:12:53.851
There's someone up here!

00:12:54.851 --> 00:12:56.101
Put some pants on.

00:12:57.651 --> 00:12:59.361
The guy on your shoulder! Kill him!

00:13:09.491 --> 00:13:12.581
Brother!

00:13:13.501 --> 00:13:15.081
How did this happen?!

00:13:15.831 --> 00:13:19.421
All I ever wanted was to be strong!

00:13:19.421 --> 00:13:22.171
And just when I finally became the strongest…

00:13:26.881 --> 00:13:31.471
I don't know who you are,
but it's your fault my brother is dead!

00:13:41.521 --> 00:13:42.781
The strongest!

00:13:43.231 --> 00:13:47.401
Behold our brotherly power!

00:14:01.041 --> 00:14:02.501
I am the strongest.

00:14:11.511 --> 00:14:13.221
But so what?

00:14:14.351 --> 00:14:15.601
I feel empty.

00:14:16.561 --> 00:14:17.561
Right?

00:14:27.991 --> 00:14:30.361
Having overwhelming strength is…

00:14:30.861 --> 00:14:32.571
pretty boring.

00:14:35.491 --> 00:14:36.121
Whoops.

00:14:36.871 --> 00:14:39.791
CITY B DESTROYED

00:14:56.181 --> 00:14:59.181
There's no sign that the evils
of the world are disappearing.

00:14:59.771 --> 00:15:03.641
It's the same as before I became a hero.

00:15:03.641 --> 00:15:07.561
In other words, you could say
I haven't made an impact.

00:15:08.271 --> 00:15:10.731
That doesn't really bother me, though.

00:15:12.361 --> 00:15:15.451
But something's been on my mind lately.

00:15:16.451 --> 00:15:19.081
As the days pass, my emotions grow more distant.

00:15:20.081 --> 00:15:24.581
Fear, tension, joy, anger…
I hardly feel anything anymore.

00:15:25.091 --> 00:15:26.891
In exchange for power,

00:15:26.891 --> 00:15:30.101
have I lost some essential
part of my humanity?

00:15:35.551 --> 00:15:37.181
Vroom, vroom?

00:15:38.511 --> 00:15:40.851
No sense hiding if you saw me.

00:15:41.181 --> 00:15:44.811
I'm Super Custom YO649Z Mk. II!

00:15:45.191 --> 00:15:49.691
I love building custom cars so much

00:15:46.441 --> 00:15:50.771
I used to feel all kinds of emotions
whirling inside me when I fought.

00:15:49.691 --> 00:15:51.531
I decided to deck myself out.

00:15:50.771 --> 00:15:53.611
Fear, panic, anger.

00:15:51.531 --> 00:15:53.611
I'm a custom car-loving monster!

00:15:53.611 --> 00:15:55.991
If you're thinking of getting in my way,

00:15:55.991 --> 00:15:59.371
I'll put a shine on that big headlight of yours!

00:16:05.161 --> 00:16:08.381
But now, all I need is one punch to end it.

00:16:11.881 --> 00:16:14.051
Guess I'll have eggs over rice tonight.

00:16:19.051 --> 00:16:23.141
Every day, I come home uninjured and wash my gloves.

00:16:24.141 --> 00:16:26.891
When I'm out fighting monsters,

00:16:26.891 --> 00:16:29.441
it never feels like my heart's really in it.

00:16:31.151 --> 00:16:34.781
I mean, I just do the hero thing as a hobby.

00:16:35.321 --> 00:16:36.071
In other words,

00:16:36.821 --> 00:16:38.531
as long as I get a kick out of it,

00:16:39.111 --> 00:16:40.451
that's all I care about.

00:17:02.471 --> 00:17:03.561
My house!

00:17:17.941 --> 00:17:19.621
He's tough!

00:17:20.411 --> 00:17:22.371
What the hell are you?

00:17:22.871 --> 00:17:25.291
"What" am I? How rude.

00:17:25.291 --> 00:17:27.371
We are the true Earthlings.

00:17:27.951 --> 00:17:29.411
"We"?

00:17:29.411 --> 00:17:33.001
I believe you call us "Subterraneans."

00:17:34.041 --> 00:17:35.841
We suffer from overpopulation.

00:17:36.671 --> 00:17:39.841
Therefore, we must now
colonize the surface world.

00:17:40.881 --> 00:17:44.011
I understand that there are
many people on the surface too.

00:17:44.011 --> 00:17:46.441
As it stands, you are in our way.

00:17:47.101 --> 00:17:48.941
That is why we have decided

00:17:48.941 --> 00:17:51.941
to return you all to the earth.

00:17:52.981 --> 00:17:59.151
Since the start of our invasion,
we have killed 70% of you surface dwellers.

00:17:59.151 --> 00:18:01.111
This is a battle for survival.

00:18:01.111 --> 00:18:03.661
I hope you can understand that.

00:18:04.911 --> 00:18:07.621
However, this is a surprise.

00:18:07.621 --> 00:18:10.791
We have never met a surface dweller
who could survive our punches.

00:18:10.791 --> 00:18:13.171
Same here.

00:18:13.171 --> 00:18:16.341
It's been too long since I last
met a worthy opponent,

00:18:16.841 --> 00:18:18.171
Subterraneans!

00:18:20.381 --> 00:18:22.141
We are Earthlings!

00:18:30.521 --> 00:18:32.151
H-How?!

00:18:33.021 --> 00:18:34.521
You bastard!

00:18:38.281 --> 00:18:39.781
Die!

00:19:31.541 --> 00:19:32.951
It's over.

00:19:34.331 --> 00:19:38.081
Who on earth was that surface dweller?

00:19:38.081 --> 00:19:39.421
I'm…

00:19:40.001 --> 00:19:43.301
just a guy who's a hero for fun.

00:19:43.761 --> 00:19:46.051
I will not lose.

00:19:46.511 --> 00:19:47.681
And the surface…

00:19:48.601 --> 00:19:50.221
is under my protection!

00:19:52.021 --> 00:19:54.231
Big talk for a race of vermin!

00:20:09.241 --> 00:20:12.331
What is this feeling?

00:20:13.331 --> 00:20:14.831
This pounding in my chest?

00:20:18.211 --> 00:20:21.591
This rush! This tension!

00:20:28.431 --> 00:20:30.681
It's been so long, I've forgotten

00:20:31.971 --> 00:20:35.931
the exhilaration of a real fight!

00:20:50.031 --> 00:20:52.781
It's coming back to me.

00:20:53.621 --> 00:20:54.491
This is it!

00:20:54.491 --> 00:20:56.041
Well, well…

00:20:56.881 --> 00:21:02.041
Looks like you've been taking good care of my children.

00:21:02.041 --> 00:21:03.171
This is it!

00:21:03.551 --> 00:21:06.931
I, the Subterranean King, will take you on.

00:21:08.641 --> 00:21:10.181
This is the feeling…

00:21:11.301 --> 00:21:13.101
I've been looking for!

00:21:29.651 --> 00:21:31.371
The surface is ours!

00:21:31.701 --> 00:21:34.121
You surface dwellers must die!

00:21:34.121 --> 00:21:35.991
I am the Subterranean King!

00:21:35.991 --> 00:21:38.711
Surface dwellers, prepare yoursel—

00:21:45.631 --> 00:21:47.551
All right, bring it on!

00:21:48.341 --> 00:21:52.101
Sorry

00:22:02.811 --> 00:22:04.731
I've become too strong.

00:22:05.611 --> 00:22:10.121
THE STRONGEST MAN

00:22:11.781 --> 00:22:18.041
Hey, come back home soon

00:22:11.781 --> 00:22:18.041
nee hayaku kaette kite ne

